# Swiggy Automation Testing Framework

Automation testing framework for the Swiggy web application using Selenium WebDriver, Java, TestNG, and Maven.

## Overview

This project is designed to automate functional testing workflows of the Swiggy web application. The framework follows a modular structure with reusable page classes, utility components, and TestNG-based execution for scalable and maintainable automation testing.

## Tech Stack

- Java
- Selenium WebDriver
- TestNG
- Maven
- Page Factory Design Pattern
- Apache POI (Excel Handling)

---

## Project Features

x Automated UI Testing  
x Functional Testing  
x TestNG Test Execution  
x Reusable Page Object Model  
x Excel Data Handling  
x Screenshot Capture Utility  
x Scalable Automation Framework  

